{"reviews":[{"id":"B09PFW98PL-0","r":5.0,"t":"I like them!","x":"They come in 3 different lengths, I like the natural ones best and those are still pretty dramatic.  The self adhesive works well the first few times but when I use the adhesive eyeliner they stay on for at least 2 days.  The case was cute too.  Make sure that you use tweezers to get them out because you don\u2019t want to touch the glue strip too much, it will lose its stickiness.  I will be ordering again.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2022"},{"id":"B09PFW98PL-1","r":5.0,"t":"Amazing!","x":"I'm  really surprise that it's  so easy to use and no need for glue...since I'm  not a pro for putting eye lashes this is the first time I enjoy and loving it.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B09PFW98PL-2","r":5.0,"t":"Great product","x":"Cozy, natural, light weight, & easy to use! Say no more, or look no more. These eyelashes are definitely the ones to get. Fast shipping, beautiful packaging, with a nice size mirror, now that\u2019s a bang for your buck!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2022"},{"id":"B09PFW98PL-3","r":1.0,"t":"Wouldn't recommend","x":"Used one set lashes & they never felt that they were going to stay on & couldn't get them to fit back in the container.  Useless.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2022"},{"id":"B09PFW98PL-4","r":5.0,"t":"Natural and Lightweight","x":"These lashes look amazing. They look exactly like the picture. They are very natural, perfect for daily wear. It is also lightweight and doesn\u2019t irritate your eyes. Definitely recommend!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2022"},{"id":"B09PFW98PL-5","r":5.0,"t":"Amazing!","x":"I absolutely love the lashes and packaging. They\u2019re super light weight, comfortable and manageable. Would highly recommend (:","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2022"},{"id":"B09PFW98PL-6","r":1.0,"t":"Do not waist your time or money","x":"The glue is not reusable. It clumps up. Once used glue does not re-stick. And that\u2019s if you get the lashes on.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2022"},{"id":"B09PFW98PL-7","r":1.0,"t":"No do not buy these.","x":"No do not buy these...very cheap made. Trust me when I say don't buy these. You will be disappointed.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2022"},{"id":"B09PFW98PL-8","r":5.0,"t":"Omg!!!","x":"Best lashes ever!!! So much better then using glue!! Love them holds very well!!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2022"},{"id":"B09PFW98PL-9","r":1.0,"t":"Terrible","x":"They do not stick, they fall off! These are nothing like they say! Do not buy!!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2022"},{"id":"B09PFW98PL-10","r":5.0,"t":"Love them\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f","x":"So light weight. I didn't have to cut them to fit my eye shape \u2764\ufe0f","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2022"},{"id":"B09PFW98PL-11","r":1.0,"t":"Doesn't stick","x":"Put on clean dry face with no makeup yet and still didn't stick.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2022"},{"id":"B09PFW98PL-12","r":1.0,"t":"Don't waste your $","x":"They don't stay on.  Don't waste your money","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2022"},{"id":"B09PFW98PL-13","r":3.0,"t":"Not what I expected","x":"The glue that was supposed to already be on the lashes got stuck on the plastic while I was taking it off, I was more careful the second set of lashes and still lost some glue in the middle of it. This was a great idea but it didn't work as supposed to. I WOULD NOT RECOMMEND THIS","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2022"},{"id":"B09PFW98PL-14","r":3.0,"t":"I would advise only buying in the winter cold months.","x":"These were beautiful but got hot in my mailbox before I grabbed them and went on vacation. When I went to use then the adhesive tore off so I could not use nor return them since I was away for too long. I would advise only buying during cold months.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2022"},{"id":"B09PFW98PL-15","r":1.0,"t":"Adhesive issues","x":"When trying to gently remove the eyelash from the plastic the adhesive gets stuck to the plastic and then rips off of eyelash. Therefore without adhesive on the eyelash they don\u2019t stick. Very disappointed.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2022"},{"id":"B09PFW98PL-16","r":2.0,"t":"Not happy at all","x":"The lashes are very lightweight and pretty durable. I wasn't aware that you can't wear the lashes but one time each. The adhesion didn't work a 2nd time around. I'm not a happy customer","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2022"},{"id":"B09PFW98PL-17","r":3.0,"t":"These are okay.\ud83d\ude0c","x":"If you wash in cold soapy water the adhesiveness returns. They are good for a few hours. Don\u2019t sleep in them, remove, wash, air dry and replace in container.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2022"},{"id":"B09PFW98PL-18","r":5.0,"t":"They're great! And delivery was quick and on time which I appreciate i","x":"I love my lashes easy to apply and I wear them everyday just love them no more extension lashes for me I will be ordering them again just to have extras.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2022"},{"id":"B09PFW98PL-19","r":1.0,"t":"Don't do it","x":"I couldn't even put them on. One set was destroyed, the other 2 where stuck on the holder so strong they ruined when I took them off.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2022"},{"id":"B09PFW98PL-20","r":1.0,"t":"Wasted time, energy and money","x":"Concept is good. Adhesive is the issue. It's not strong enough. So I got what I paid for. A cheap price for a cheaply made adhesive.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2022"},{"id":"B09PFW98PL-21","r":1.0,"t":"They are too wide for my eyes; they are NOT reusable/ unhappy with purchase","x":"They are too wide for my eyes/ they are are NOT reusable-did not stick same way second time/ not happy with this  purchase","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2022"},{"id":"B09PFW98PL-22","r":1.0,"t":"Good for one time use","x":"Nice case, nice looking lashes, lashes stayed on for the first  use  only. These are definitely not multiple use lashes!!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2022"},{"id":"B09PFW98PL-23","r":5.0,"t":"Very good quality.","x":"They are very light on the eyes. And adhesive is so better than some glue I've used. Love how easy to put on and remove.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2022"},{"id":"B09PFW98PL-24","r":1.0,"t":"Very disappointment","x":"I was excited to try these lashes, The case was hard to open and adhesive on the lashes  and it didn\u2019t stick that well","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2022"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers find the lashes lightweight, natural-looking, and comfortable to wear.","cites":[3,5,6,11]},{"text":"Several reviewers praise how easy the lashes are to apply without glue.","cites":[2,3,9]},{"text":"A common complaint is that the lashes or adhesive do not stick and fall off.","cites":[10,12,13,14]},{"text":"Some reviewers report the adhesive is not reusable and clumps or tears off.","cites":[7,14,15]},{"text":"Reviewers also mention liking the packaging and case.","cites":[1,3,6]}]},"qa":[]}